on a 2.6.8.1 host with the 2.6.7 skas3 patch applied.

We also continue to have an issue with the /proc/PID/environ file not being
owned by the process involved. This keeps our automatic cleaner from
getting the processes which are strays. 

I wonder if these things are related.
